WEBVTT

00:03:59.179 --> 00:04:03.268
(Gelach)

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.532
Heb je gewonnen? Had je hem? Had je hem? Prima!

00:04:09.532 --> 00:04:12.049
(Applaus)

00:04:12.049 --> 00:04:15.591
Goed gedaan. Bedankt. Hartelijk bedankt.

00:04:15.591 --> 00:04:16.996
Goed.

00:04:16.996 --> 00:04:20.408
Terwijl je nog even nageniet

00:04:20.408 --> 00:04:22.210
van je eerste gewonnen potje

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:23.825
massively multiplayer duimpje-drukken,

00:04:23.825 --> 00:04:26.415
lopen we even de positieve emoties na.

00:04:26.415 --> 00:04:28.354
Nieuwsgierigheid.

00:04:28.354 --> 00:04:30.326
Ik zei 'massively multiplayer duimpje-drukken'.